Tattoo + onsen in Japan? Ask this before you undress ♨️
Rules differ by onsen, so always ask first.

Today's phrases:
• タトゥー (tatoo) = Tattoo
• だいじょうぶですか (daijoubu desu ka) = Is it okay?
• ごゆっくり どうぞ (goyukkuri douzo) = Please take your time

